@model YallaJo.Web.Areas.Accounts.Models.Overview.OverviewVm
@* Phase 5a (Accounts plan): Overview "Upcoming trips" rail body — ERR3 retryable, AJAX-reloadable. *@
@if (Model.BookingsFailed)
{
    <div class="text-center py-4">
        <p class="text-muted mb-2">@Localizer["Accounts.Overview.BookingsFailed"]</p>
        <a asp-area="Accounts" asp-controller="Overview" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary js-overview-retry">@Localizer["Accounts.Overview.Retry"]</a>
    </div>
}
else if (Model.UpcomingBookings is { Count: > 0 })
{
    <div class="vstack gap-3">
        @foreach (var b in Model.UpcomingBookings)
        {
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center border rounded p-3 gap-2">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="h6 mb-1">@b.TourName</h3>
                    <div class="small text-muted">
                        <span class="me-3"><i class="bi bi-calendar3 me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>@b.Date.ToString("d MMM yyyy")</span>
                        <span><i class="bi bi-people me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>@b.ParticipantCount guest(s)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <partial name="_StatusBadge" model="@b.Status" />
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary-soft mb-0"
                       asp-area="Accounts" asp-controller="Bookings" asp-action="Detail" asp-route-id="@b.Id">Manage</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
}
else
{
    <div class="text-center py-4">
        <p class="text-muted mb-2">No upcoming trips yet.</p>
        <a asp-area="Public" asp-controller="Tours" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Explore tours</a>
    </div>
}
